title: "CHEM-02: Prediction-regime benchmark for binary-solvent solubility"
version: "1.0.0"
license: MIT
abstract: >
  Research code for MixtureSolDB preprocessing, grouped and out-of-domain
  solubility prediction experiments, and classical mixture-correlation
  benchmarking under distinct experimental-information regimes.
keywords:
  - binary-solvent solubility
  - chemical domain shift
  - Jouyban-Acree
  - thermodynamic modeling
  - reproducible machine learning
